<title>POLAND: BFK 1996 net rises to PLN 52 mln.</title>
<headline>BFK 1996 net rises to PLN 52 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFK SA results for the year</p>
<p>ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			51.99 vs   40.44</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  43.72 vs   21.74</p>
<p>    net profit				24.01 vs   11.70</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bydgoska Fabryka Kabli SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				357.57 vs  313.44</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 261.53 vs  254.26</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.06 vs    0.11</p>
<p>    income tax				19.71 vs    9.93</p>
<p>    other taxes				na   vs     na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     5.55 vs    4.85</p>
<p>    financial costs			 13.94 vs   23.55</p>
<p>    investment				26.55 vs   32.33</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
